     "id": 1168032,
     "content_html": "An alliance was signed with the French to gain economic and military support."
    },
    {
     "id": 1168031,
     "content_html": "American Indians led a coordinated attack on frontier outposts, stunning the British troops there."
    },
    {
     "id": 1168030,
     "content_html": "Women began creating clothes at home to boycott the British influx of goods."
    }
